<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="FR" style="color:black">Nous vous prions de trouver ci-dessous un/des contrats &nbsp;qui arrive(nt) &agrave; terme et pour </span>le<span style="color:#1f497d">(s)</span>que<span style="color:#1f497d">l(s) </span>nous n&rsquo;avons pas d&rsquo;information sur la suite &agrave; donner.</span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif">Merci de bien vouloir nous indiquer par retour de mail&nbsp;:</span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></span>
<ul>
